":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-07T23:32:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T14:20:18Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot v.4.7.dev \n- Reproducible in Godot v4.6.stable\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.5.1.stable \n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot v4.5.1.stable.official - Vulkan (Forward+) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 4070 Ti SUPER\n\n### Issue description\n\nIdentical meshes with identical StandardMaterial3Ds will have inconsistent lighting relative to its rotation if Normals are enabled in the material's setting\n\n<img width=\"2194\" height=\"1378\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72ceee1d-15f9-4bd3-8dbd-095258b76ac6\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project with a Node3D scene.\n2. Add a WorldEnvironment with default Procedural Sky, Add a DirectionalLight3D\n3. Add a MeshInstance3D with a Box mesh, Attach a new StandardMaterial3D\n4. In the material, enable Normal. (For better visibility of the issue, adjust the Albedo color, boost Normal strength, and up Roughness. No other options should be enabled).\n5. Duplicate the cube, move it next to the original, then rotate it 90 degrees\n\nThe issue can now be seen and reproduced, in editor preview and in game.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116025/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116025/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}